From c602cce04cebcdb0f26da6f96bbb459d28dbe3ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Nair <stefan.nair97@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 20:21:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Launcher: half_grid one-row layout with outlined free
 slots (local TCL 75C755 setup)

Local change for one TV, not for upstream:
- half_grid (theme key, off by default): rows under the dock hold
  2 x columns tiles at about half size, so the dock plus all seven
  other apps fit the first screen. Dock tiles span two grid columns.
  A third view type sizes the half tiles (11sp names).
- Up/Down/Left/Right, the reorder mode, Down from the top bar and Up
  from the library use dock-aware row maths (rowStart/above/below/
  dockColumn); without half_grid they reduce to the old arithmetic.
- HalfGridSlots draws a faint dashed outline in each free slot of the
  last half row (drawn only, never focusable).

APK 590,965 bytes, 1,141 over the 589,824 gate (accepted for this
personal build). testReleaseUnitTest: 314 passed. Tested on the TV:
20/20 D-pad moves, reorder within the half row and dock <-> half row.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
